After completing all sixteen sections, I think Phase-00 has become the constitutional document of Stage-23, but I would make one observation before we proceed.

I believe Phase-01 (Discovery & Reverse Engineering) will be the first phase where COREI starts becoming truly unique. Rather than simply researching VS Code, Bloomberg, TradingView, Grafana, JetBrains, and institutional platforms, we will reverse engineer why they are successful, extract reusable engineering principles, compare them against the Anchor Law and Master Trader Persona, and determine what belongs in COREI and what does not.

